{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY with without headaches !!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes is a first-person shooter online with the bare minimum to define it as such... Indeed, you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-reload</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-run</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-crawl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated special power, no different weapons with convoluted statistics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Online Game !</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win against your friends a single aspect to master, aim!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For the little story...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s my first game on Steam... and the project started with a small challenge that quickly took on disproportionate proportions (at my level) .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s why I would like to have feedback and areas for improvement for the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you :)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"YES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918570/e54ba79f6bb31e5d121b291b9add5d4d2167199a.jpg"},{"name":"actually","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3918570/59683cb951de2771cd122fdbb10d7ff04140f185.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918570?t=1766594145","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918570/38fce283c94d12d911559fbb5211703413129f66/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766594145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918570/ba386a628fb824b6ed6f9534cf9b0a3305039934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766594145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto